{
  "method": "Measured cobalt blue, chrome yellow lemon, eosin lake, bone black and zinc white oil paints (Revigo reconstruction of Van Gogh's palette); K and S per wavelength from 100 um films over black and white, pure and mixed with zinc white and bone black; plain linear two-constant KM with calibrated constant recipe weights; finite 100 um film over the fixed measured 07A white field, shown specular-excluded; exact spectral decoder clipped to the sRGB cube, inverse fitted with clipped and raw RGB error with near-white nodes stored as the white vertex, plus linear RGB residual",
